<title>USA: Laredo, Texas, bonds free to trade.</title>
<headline>Laredo, Texas, bonds free to trade.</headline>
<text>
<p>CITY OF LAREDO, TEXAS</p>
<p>RE: $12,295,000</p>
<p>(WEBB COUNTY)</p>
<p>NEW SERIES 1996</p>
<p>NOT BANK QUALIFIED</p>
<p>WRITTEN AWARD RECEIVED</p>
<p>TRADE DATE IS TODAY, MONDAY, AUGUST 26, 1996.</p>
<p>EFFECTIVE IMMEDIATELY ALL SYNDICATE TERMS AND PRICE</p>
<p>RESTRICTIONS ARE REMOVED AND THE BONDS ARE FREE TO TRADE.</p>
<p>First Southwest Company</p>
<p>Rauscher Pierce Refsnes, Inc.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
